 "_structures_comment": [
  "STRUCTURES — how many asks and of which types. `asks` lists the action",
  "class per position ('e' create_event, 't' create_todo, 'q' query,",
  "'u' update_event, 'd' delete_event); the composer picks a concrete",
  "skeleton of that class in the family's register. `pool` is which sampling",
  "pool the structure feeds: 'faithful' rows are drawn at the ask-count",
  "marginals MEASURED in the real history, 'stress' rows oversample the",
  "multi-ask tail for mining and per-shape diagnosis (see REALSPEECH.md)."
 ],
