 "_null_comment": [
  "NULL rows — 4.8% of the real history is an utterance carrying no ask at",
  "all: a bare wake word, a cut-off syllable, an answer to a question the",
  "assistant never asked. Creating anything from one of these is the most",
  "visible failure the store contains, so they are kept as their own family."
 ],
